            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth Were paran waco ama: Bedi jakwath rombo pa mwendi ma joripo athumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jono ma jonyewo jo jothumo to jokadho m'ongoye gir'acula, aka jono ma jotana jo jowaco ni, “Rwoth wopak, atieko ŋaŋo; aka jokwath pajo jongoye gi wor kwoŋ jo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kole akilamako wor gi ji ma piny me kendo, Rwoth waco. To neni, alaweyo kisi dhano i cingi jager pere, kodi i cingi kere pere, jolaŋinyo piny, aka ongoye ŋata bino botho wok i cingi jo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwayo mwendi ma ripo athumo, riameno jolimo litho. Akwanyo ludhe ario, acel alwoŋo ni Nema, aka man alwoŋo ni Riwirok; t'akwayo mwendi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asika woko jokwath rombo adek i dwe acel, akibedo moth gi jo, aka bende jodakan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno awaco ni, “Akilabedo jakwath rombo mewin, ma tho weyi wotho, m'orey woko weyi worere, aka weyi ma joboth jowocami delkwoŋ wadi jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwanyo luth paran ma Nema, aturo woko, ma turo woko cikirok m'atimo gi ji je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo no, maluth otur'iye, mwendi m'oyido jolimo litho, m'oyido joŋiyan, joŋeyo nike oyido obedo wac pa Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.27.9+MAT.27.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 27:9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 26:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awaco rijo ni, ka ber ruwaŋ win, miyan win cul paran, to ka be, weyi win.” Ameno jopima cul paran feza piero adek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ran ni, “Bol i kakan ri jacwey degi, cul ma dicwe ma joculan. Ameno atero feza piero adek, t'abolo i Ot pa Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aturo luth mar'ario, ma Riwirok, ma turo wat i dier Yuda kodi Isiraili.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ran kendo ni, “Kwany iloki aperin, gigipiny pa jakwath rombo mamiŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole ee, acegin tiŋo malo jakwath rombo i piny, ma kidew kwoŋ m'ireyo woko, k'orangi ma jokedhere, k'ocangi ma jotur, kosa k'opidhi ma joboth. To go lacamo woko riŋo pa ma jocwe, aka layeco woko lwet jo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
